visited to find someone to do those things?

18:07.884 --> 18:10.876
He didn't have to go abroad,
he was just looking for a bargain.

18:11.054 --> 18:15.150
If it werert for you, he would never have
contracted amoebic dysentery and died.

18:15.325 --> 18:21.355
I hate to interrupt, but I'm still trying
to process the "I'm her brother" thing.

18:21.531 --> 18:24.989
Mm. Not the shiniest penny in the roll,
is he?

18:25.535 --> 18:28.163
Now, all right, I guess
I'd better spell it out for you.

18:28.605 --> 18:30.573
Based on the amount of time
that elapsed...

18:30.740 --> 18:34.141
...between the last fondue party
and Gloria's birth...

18:34.310 --> 18:38.371
...and not to mention the fact that Sherman
lost interest in traditional sex with me...

18:38.815 --> 18:40.009
Thank you very much.

18:40.917 --> 18:45.581
- There is the very real possibility
that your father may be her father.

18:46.222 --> 18:47.416
- Oh, my God.
- Wow.

18:47.590 --> 18:51.424
So you can see why a tryst of this nature
is completely unacceptable.

18:51.894 --> 18:54.522
It's not like we couldn't have
foreseen this...

18:54.697 --> 18:57.564
...given that your son
has spent the bulk of his adult life...

18:57.734 --> 19:00.828
...humping his way
through the greater Los Angeles area.

19:02.038 --> 19:04.871
Oh, and like this booze-addled tart
is an innocent victim.

19:05.041 --> 19:07.566
Hey, I'm drunk, not deaf.

19:08.111 --> 19:10.272
Just get out of bed and get dressed.

19:12.382 --> 19:14.441
Well, that was humiliating.

19:14.617 --> 19:17.552
Be glad we didn't have to tell them
about our little experiment.

19:17.720 --> 19:20.484
EvELYN: Don't remind me.
DoRoTHY: Oh, you loved it.

19:20.990 --> 19:23.788
Oh, a third-act twist. Ha.

19:25.328 --> 19:26.625
Wow.

19:26.796 --> 19:31.233
- Yeah.
- I am so horny right now I can't believe it.

19:31.401 --> 19:32.993
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

19:34.170 --> 19:37.003
Did you miss
what just went down here, sis?

19:37.540 --> 19:40.031
Oh, come on. It's not like
we're gonna get married...

19:40.209 --> 19:42.404
...and have a bunch of web-footed kids.

19:44.013 --> 19:46.811
You have absolutely no boundaries,
do you?

19:47.350 --> 19:50.615
Well, I don't like fat guys.

19:52.755 --> 19:54.450
Interesting.

19:55.024 --> 19:58.790
Turns out I draw the line at incest.

19:59.329 --> 20:01.889
So you'd do a fat guy?

20:03.499 --> 20:05.091
Did you hear that?

20:05.268 --> 20:07.065
Charlie found his boundary.

20:07.236 --> 20:08.430
It's a miracle.

20:08.604 --> 20:10.367
A Christmas miracle.

20:21.084 --> 20:24.850
Judith, can I just say
that this was the best Christmas ever.

20:25.288 --> 20:27.347
Yeah, well, don't get used to it.

20:27.824 --> 20:31.282
&lt;i>'Twas the night before Christmas
And all through the house&lt;/i>

20:31.461 --> 20:33.691
&lt;i>Not a creature was stirring...&lt;/i>

20:38.368 --> 20:42.304
Okay, just so we're clear,
you're only doing this to piss off my mom?

20:42.905 --> 20:44.372
Do you have a problem with that?

20:44.540 --> 20:45.939
No, that makes it better.
